<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="09">
<name>SRS Airbag &amp; Seat Belt</name>
<section id="1002M_S001G" variety="S001G">
<name>Pre-crash Safety</name>
<ttl id="1002M_S001G_74WT7_T00FP" variety="T00FP">
<name>Pre-crash Safety System</name>
<para id="RM0000006E500JX" category="D" type-id="3001B" name-id="540IZ-00" from="200708">
<name>How to Proceed with Troubleshooting</name>
<subpara id="RM0000006E500JX_z0" proc-id="RM0550J___0000CT400000">
<content5 releasenbr="2">
<descript-diag>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Vehicle brought to workshop</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Customer Problem Analysis and Symptom Check</testtitle>
<atten4>
<ptxt>For the procedure, refer to <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000006E600JX"/>.</ptxt>
</atten4>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Preliminary Inspection</testtitle>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), inspect the battery voltage.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Voltage</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>11 to 14 V (Engine Stopped)</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Referring to the parts location and wiring diagrams, inspect areas that can be checked visually, such as blown fuses, open circuits or short circuits in the wire harness and poor connector connections in the system.</ptxt>
</test1>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>CAN Communication System Check</testtitle>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), display the "CAN Bus Diagnosis/CAN Bus Connected ECU Check" screen and check all ECUs and sensors connected to CAN communication. (see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM0000005S001VX"/>)</ptxt>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.79in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.34in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>No Abnormality</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Abnormal</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</test1>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to CAN Communication System Section (<xref label="Seep03" href="RM000001R4W00DX"/>)</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Check DTC</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check DTC (see <xref label="Seep04" href="RM0000006EM00JX"/>)</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Record all current and past DTCs.</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Clear DTC</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Recheck DTC</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Based on the recorded DTCs, reproduce the malfunction symptom and check whether the DTCs are output again.</ptxt>
<atten4>
<ptxt>When DTCs are output, refer to "Diagnostic Trouble Code Chart" (<xref label="Seep05" href="RM0000006E700NX"/>).</ptxt>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.25in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="0.88in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>No code, symptom can be confirmed and reproduced</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>No code, symptom cannot be confirmed and reproduced</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Code output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>C</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</atten4>
</test2>
</test1>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to Symptom Simulation (<xref label="Seep06" href="RM000000ABY04BX"/>)</action-ci-right>
<result>C</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to step 8</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>List by Symptom</testtitle>
<atten4>
<ptxt>For the procedure, refer to <xref label="Seep07" href="RM0000006EA00IX"/>.</ptxt>
</atten4>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.79in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.34in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Not listed in List by Symptom</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Corresponds to List by Symptom</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to step 8</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Perform troubleshooting using the following methods based on the problem symptom</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>ECU Data Monitor/Active Test (see <xref label="Seep08" href="RM0000006EO00LX"/>)</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>ECU Data Monitor (TaSCAN)</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Active Test (TaSCAN)</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Terminals of ECU (see <xref label="Seep09" href="RM0000006E900JX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Adjust, Repair or Replace</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Confirmation Test</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
<action-ci-fin>END</action-ci-fin>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
</descript-diag>
</content5>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
</tmc-service-inc>